            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Why choose a carpet cleaner?",
            "text": "<p>Carpet cleaners use water and shampoo to deep clean the fibres of carpets, rugs and upholstery. Removing stains, pet mess and odours that ordinary vacuum cleaners and steamers can't. They can even revive old carpets that you may otherwise have considered replacing.</p>",
