          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "What are carpet spot cleaners used for?",
            "text": "<p>Designed for busy homes with children and pets, spot cleaners quickly remove spills and stains from deep within carpets, rugs and soft furnishings. They're ideal for tackling ground-in dirt and muddy paw prints.</p>",
